<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-5-balanced-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 5. This set offers a more balanced playstyle, focusing on making efficient offensive trades while highly valuing defensive utility.<br/>
<br/>While this list forgoes certain efficient defensive trades, as they lack value when overgeared, it'll be very wise to consider Stamina and Dodge shoulder/<wbr/>leg enchants while progressing.<br/>
<br/>If you do not wish to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105568/vial-of-living-corruption">
<img alt="Vial of Living Corruption" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vial of Living Corruption</span></a>, as it may be unnecessary while the content is on farm, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105632/skeers-bloodsoaked-talisman">
<img alt="Skeer's Bloodsoaked Talisman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skeer's Bloodsoaked Talisman</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105527/haromms-talisman">
<img alt="Haromm's Talisman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haromm's Talisman</span></a> will offer the most throughput. That said, taking an agility trinket as a tank might be contentious, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105609/thoks-tail-tip">
<img alt="Thok's Tail Tip" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thok's Tail Tip</span></a> is not far behind. <br/>
